quarkusio/quarkus/issues/23678#issuecomment-1055786543","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/23678","id":1055786543,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCFbutM4-7gYv","user":{"login":"pwlan","id":4169004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNjkwMDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4169004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan","html_url":"https://github.com/pwlan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-03-01T19:33:04Z","updated_at":"2022-03-01T19:41:41Z","body":"Hi, \r\nI have the exact same error message, but without using flow. I did some digging and found\r\n```\r\nclass KotlinSerializationMessageBodyWriter(private val json: Json) : AllWriteableMessageBodyWriter() {\r\n\r\n    override fun writeTo(\r\n        o: Any, type: Class<*>, genericType: Type, annotations: Array<Annotation>, mediaType: MediaType,\r\n        httpHeaders: MultivaluedMap<String, Any>, entityStream: OutputStream\r\n    ) {\r\n        JsonMessageBodyWriterUtil.setContentTypeIfNecessary(httpHeaders)\r\n        if (o is String) { // YUK: done in order to avoid adding extra quotes...\r\n            entityStream.write(o.toByteArray(StandardCharsets.UTF_8))\r\n        } else {\r\n            json.encodeToStream(o, entityStream)\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n```\r\nMy guess is that the 'Any' from the error message is referring to the parameter 'o' here.\r\n`encodeToStream` uses a reified type parameter to determine the Serializer. \r\nAnd this would be 'Any' and not the exact type.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/1055786543/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"pwlan","id":4169004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNjkwMDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4169004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan","html_url":"https://github.com/pwlan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pwlan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":6196814800,"node_id":"AE_lADOCFbutM5Dzg7ZzwAAAAFxW-PQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/6196814800","actor":{"login":"evanchooly","id":195021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NTAyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanchooly","html_url":"https://github.com/evanchooly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanchooly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanchooly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanchooly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users